        "created_at": "2012-11-25T07:26:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Okay, he's the deal: I think what will&nbsp;<em>likely</em> happen is that Fright Train will be&nbsp;<em>one&nbsp;</em>of Bunker's nemeses. He could have another, but Fright Train will just be one of them. I think the point of Vengeance is that the Vengeful Five are all nemeses of Freedom Five members (or at least consider themselves to be). So while they might not be THE nemesis for each hero, I feel like the nemesis icons will come into play.</p>",
