        "created_at": "2012-11-25T12:15:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Considering the two reveals so far (Fright and Ermine), I get the feeling that all of the V5 are the Freedom Five's nemeses in a \"Dude you are not my nemesis\" way. &nbsp;The Freedom Five members don't even give them (individually) a second thought, but when they start working together they become a serious threat.</p>",
